text":"She knew that it must be the baker.","start":65.03,"end":67.12,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-010-p01","sourceId":"b3-013-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She had told him to come straight in","start":67.98,"end":69.6,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-010-p02","sourceId":"b3-013-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[8,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"if ever she failed to open the door and to leave the bread on the kitchen table.","start":69.78,"end":74.56,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-011","sourceId":"b3-013-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Not wanting to frighten the poor man, Mrs. Richards quickly hid in the small storeroom under the stairs.","start":76.02,"end":82.76,"score":0.905,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-012","sourceId":"b3-013-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She heard the front door open and heavy footsteps in the hall.","start":84.04,"end":87.99,"score":0.947,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-013","sourceId":"b3-013-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Suddenly the door of the storeroom was opened and a man entered.","start":88.93,"end":93.84,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-014","sourceId":"b3-013-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Mrs. Richards realized that it must be the man from the Electricity Board who had come to read the metre.","start":94.78,"end":101.53,"score":0.926,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-015","sourceId":"b3-013-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She tried to explain the situation, saying 'It's only me', but it was too late.","start":102.48,"end":107.68,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-016","sourceId":"b3-013-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The man let out a cry and jumped back several paces.","start":108.38,"end":111.88,"score":0.968,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-013-017","sourceId":"b3-013-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When Mrs. Richards walked towards him, he fled, slamming the door behind him.","start":112.74,"end":117.2,"score":0.955,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
